#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Candidate 04: causal liquidity-transition day-trading research harness.

The candidate converts ICT/SMC concepts into an explicit state machine:

    established liquidity pool -> sweep/acceptance -> displacement/hold
    -> next-bar execution -> target/invalidation/timeout

The fast path is deliberately bar-by-bar and causal.  It is used to reject weak
alpha quickly before the same strategy is replayed through NautilusTrader.
"""

